{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Okay, so you are going to create a template. That template has basically a list of all the products available on the website. It is from a collection; it is not all the products; it is the products that are under a certain collection.
    You will show the images. Make sure that there is padding towards the left and the right side of the website, a little padding so that the buttons and the images do not overflow. There should be:
    - the image
    - the price (the original price if it is cut off) and then the discounted price
    - the name of the product as well
    - below that, a view product button
    Above all this, there should be a filter and sort button, above which there should be a collection name button. If the collection name is earring, that earring should be in the centre. At the top, below that, towards the left-hand side, there should be a filter and sort button. I can be able to sort by alphabetically A to Z and Z to A, price-wise higher to lower, lower to higher as well as date-wise, old to new and new to old. I should also be able to filter:
    - availability (in stock or out of stock)
    - price range
    Reset and apply buttons should also be there. Since this is a template, I will be clicking, let's say, best sellers from another part of the page. Once I click on that, this page will open, so make sure that the collection is taken directly from what I have clicked. Make sure that it looks good on phone as well. Make sure it is responsive. , Few things:
    - The collection title should be all capitals, underlined, and in the New York font.
    - The buttons that are present, the view product button and the filter sort button, are black buttons with white text. Make them white buttons with black text.
    - The filter and sort button should be one button, and it should have both the features in that one button and have no borders for the filter and sort button, so it will just be black text.
    - Also, each and every product has a border around them; remove this border., Also, when my mouse hovers over the product, it sort of pops up or something. There's that effect; remove that effect. Also, the view product and the statement earring, all of these texts, should be in the new york font. The collection title should not be bold. The view product text should be in capital. The filter and sort button is a sort of a pop-up. It should not be that; it should be a sidebar kind of thing. , Reduce the text size of the view product button. The button is way too big, and the photos are way too small, so make the photos bigger and the text inside the button smaller. Also, the rectangle that is around the view product is curved on the edges; make it sharp. , Make the images bigger. , Okay, now make it infinite scrollable, as in when I scroll down, more products continuously are loading infinitely. Right now, a set of what, 12 to 20 products are being shown, and then let's just stop. As soon as I scroll down, more should appear. , I cannot. When I scroll down towards the end of the products that are already shown, more products should load, right, but they are not loading. It's just not loading. It should continuously keep loading more and more products as soon as I scroll down. , Ok, perfect. The only issue is that you are displaying the price of the products wrong. That is all. The issue is just to make the price of the products right. And also, when they click on the photo or the name, you show the view product page, but the view product button at the bottom changes to add to cart. So, it directly adds to the cart, but if they want to view product, they can click on the product, not click on the add to cart. , The issue is if in the mobile view, especially if the text or the title or the name of the product of one product is larger than the other one, so that it takes more space. Obviously, so the buttons of the add to cart are not in the same line if there are two side-by-side. Can you please make sure that a fixed amount of space is given to each of the product titles/names? , Okay, perfect. Please just make the images a little bigger. Everything else is fine.
    
    Secondly, the philtre and sort button - can you just add a very thin border around that button? So that we know it's a button.
    
    Lastly, on the top right corner of each and every photo, add a button that has a heart in it, which will add it directly to the wish list. 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-collection-template-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0 {{ block.settings.horizontal_padding }}px;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-collection-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .ai-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'New York', serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: underline;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    font-weight: normal;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
  }

  .ai-collection-controls-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .ai-filter-sort-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid #000000;
    color: #000000;
    font-family: 'New York', serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 10px 20px;
  }

  .ai-filter-sort-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-sidebar-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    z-index: 999;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease, visibility 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-sidebar-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
  }

  .ai-filter-sidebar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: -400px;
    width: 400px;
    height: 100%;
    background: #ffffff;
    z-index: 1000;
    padding: 30px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    transition: left 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-filter-sidebar-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    left: 0;
  }

  .ai-sidebar-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .ai-sidebar-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'New York', serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-sidebar-close-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    font-size: 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
  }

  .ai-filter-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .ai-filter-section-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'New York', serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }} input[type="checkbox"],
  .ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }} input[type="radio"] {
    margin-right: 10px;
  }

  .ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }} label {
    font-family: 'New York', serif;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-price-range-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-price-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100px;
    padding: 8px;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    font-family: 'New York', serif;
  }

  .ai-filter-actions-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .ai-filter-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    font-family: 'New York', serif;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid #000000;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #000000;
  }

  .ai-filter-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}.primary {
    background: #000000;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-products-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.products_per_row }}, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.grid_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 140%;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    overflow: hidden;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-wishlist-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    right: 10px;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #000000;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    z-index: 2;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-wishlist-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: #000000;
  }

  .ai-wishlist-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover svg {
    fill: #ffffff;
    stroke: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-wishlist-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active svg {
    fill: #ff0000;
    stroke: #ff0000;
  }

  .ai-wishlist-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: #000000;
    stroke-width: 2;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'New York', serif;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ai-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #000000;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    min-height: 48px;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .ai-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-size: 14px;
    min-height: 20px;
  }

  .ai-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    color: #999;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .ai-price-regular-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #000000;
  }

  .ai-price-sale-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #d00;
  }

  .ai-add-to-cart-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #000000;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    font-family: 'New York', serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 0;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .ai-add-to-cart-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: #000000;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-loading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px;
    font-family: 'New York', serif;
  }

  .ai-no-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    font-family: 'New York', serif;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-products-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .ai-filter-sidebar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      left: -100%;
    }

    .ai-collection-template-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 {{ block.settings.horizontal_padding_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
      min-height: 42px;
    }

    .ai-wishlist-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
    }

    .ai-wishlist-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<collection-template-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-collection-template-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  data-collection-handle="{{ collection.handle }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-collection-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <h1 class="ai-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ collection.title }}</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-collection-controls-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <button class="ai-filter-sort-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-filter-toggle>
      Filter & Sort
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-sidebar-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-sidebar-overlay></div>

  <div class="ai-filter-sidebar-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-filter-sidebar>
    <div class="ai-sidebar-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-sidebar-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Filter & Sort</h2>
      <button class="ai-sidebar-close-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-sidebar-close>&times;</button>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-filter-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h3 class="ai-filter-section-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Sort By</h3>
      <div class="ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <input type="radio" name="sort-{{ ai_gen_id }}" value="title-asc" id="sort-az-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <label for="sort-az-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Alphabetically, A-Z</label>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <input type="radio" name="sort-{{ ai_gen_id }}" value="title-desc" id="sort-za-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <label for="sort-za-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Alphabetically, Z-A</label>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <input type="radio" name="sort-{{ ai_gen_id }}" value="price-asc" id="sort-price-low-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <label for="sort-price-low-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Price, Low to High</label>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <input type="radio" name="sort-{{ ai_gen_id }}" value="price-desc" id="sort-price-high-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <label for="sort-price-high-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Price, High to Low</label>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <input type="radio" name="sort-{{ ai_gen_id }}" value="created-asc" id="sort-old-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <label for="sort-old-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Date, Old to New</label>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <input type="radio" name="sort-{{ ai_gen_id }}" value="created-desc" id="sort-new-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <label for="sort-new-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Date, New to Old</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-filter-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h3 class="ai-filter-section-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Availability</h3>
      <div class="ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <input type="checkbox" id="in-stock-{{ ai_gen_id }}" value="in-stock">
        <label for="in-stock-{{ ai_gen_id }}">In Stock</label>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-filter-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <input type="checkbox" id="out-stock-{{ ai_gen_id }}" value="out-stock">
        <label for="out-stock-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Out of Stock</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-filter-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h3 class="ai-filter-section-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Price Range</h3>
      <div class="ai-price-range-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <input type="number" class="ai-price-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}" placeholder="Min" data-price-min>
        <span>-</span>
        <input type="number" class="ai-price-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}" placeholder="Max" data-price-max>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-filter-actions-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <button class="ai-filter-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-reset-filters>Reset</button>
      <button class="ai-filter-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} primary" data-apply-filters>Apply</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-products-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-products-grid></div>

  <div class="ai-loading-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-loading style="display: none;">
    Loading more products...
  </div>
</collection-template-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(function() {
  class CollectionTemplate{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
    constructor() {
      super();
      this.collectionHandle = this.dataset.collectionHandle || 'all';
      this.currentPage = 1;
      this.isLoading = false;
      this.hasMoreProducts = true;
      this.allProducts = [];
      this.filteredProducts = [];
      this.filters = {
        sort: null,
        availability: [],
        priceMin: null,
        priceMax: null
      };
      this.wishlist = this.getWishlist();
    }

    connectedCallback() {
      this.productsGrid = this.querySelector('[data-products-grid]');
      this.loadingIndicator = this.querySelector('[data-loading]');
      this.filterToggle = this.querySelector('[data-filter-toggle]');
      this.filterSidebar = this.querySelector('[data-filter-sidebar]');
      this.sidebarOverlay = this.querySelector('[data-sidebar-overlay]');
      this.sidebarClose = this.querySelector('[data-sidebar-close]');
      this.applyButton = this.querySelector('[data-apply-filters]');
      this.resetButton = this.querySelector('[data-reset-filters]');

      this.setupEventListeners();
      this.loadProducts();
      this.setupInfiniteScroll();
    }

    setupEventListeners() {
      this.filterToggle.addEventListener('click', () => this.openSidebar());
      this.sidebarClose.addEventListener('click', () => this.closeSidebar());
      this.sidebarOverlay.addEventListener('click', () => this.closeSidebar());
      this.applyButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.applyFilters());
      this.resetButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.resetFilters());
    }

    openSidebar() {
      this.filterSidebar.classList.add('active');
      this.sidebarOverlay.classList.add('active');
      document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
    }

    closeSidebar() {
      this.filterSidebar.classList.remove('active');
      this.sidebarOverlay.classList.remove('active');
      document.body.style.overflow = '';
    }

    async loadProducts() {
      if (this.isLoading || !this.hasMoreProducts) return;

      this.isLoading = true;
      this.loadingIndicator.style.display = 'block';

      try {
        const response = await fetch(`/collections/${this.collectionHandle}/products.json?page=${this.currentPage}&limit=250`);
        const data = await response.json();

        if (data.products && data.products.length > 0) {
          this.allProducts = this.allProducts.concat(data.products);
          this.currentPage++;
          
          if (data.products.length < 250) {
            this.hasMoreProducts = false;
          }
        } else {
          this.hasMoreProducts = false;
        }

        this.applyFilters();
      } catch (error) {
        console.error('Error loading products:', error);
        this.hasMoreProducts = false;
      } finally {
        this.isLoading = false;
        this.loadingIndicator.style.display = 'none';
      }
    }

    applyFilters() {
      const sortRadios = this.querySelectorAll('input[name="sort-{{ ai_gen_id }}"]:checked');
      const availabilityCheckboxes = this.querySelectorAll('#in-stock-{{ ai_gen_id }}:checked, #out-stock-{{ ai_gen_id }}:checked');
      const priceMin = this.querySelector('[data-price-min]').value;
      const priceMax = this.querySelector('[data-price-max]').value;

      this.filters.sort = sortRadios.length > 0 ? sortRadios[0].value : null;
      this.filters.availability = Array.from(availabilityCheckboxes).map(cb => cb.value);
      this.filters.priceMin = priceMin ? parseFloat(priceMin) * 100 : null;
      this.filters.priceMax = priceMax ? parseFloat(priceMax) * 100 : null;

      this.filteredProducts = this.allProducts.filter(product => {
        if (this.filters.availability.length > 0) {
          const isInStock = product.available;
          const showInStock = this.filters.availability.includes('in-stock');
          const showOutStock = this.filters.availability.includes('out-stock');
          
          if (showInStock && !showOutStock && !isInStock) return false;
          if (showOutStock && !showInStock && isInStock) return false;
        }

        const price = parseFloat(product.variants[0].price) * 100;
        if (this.filters.priceMin !== null && price < this.filters.priceMin) return false;
        if (this.filters.priceMax !== null && price > this.filters.priceMax) return false;

        return true;
      });

      if (this.filters.sort) {
        this.filteredProducts.sort((a, b) => {
          switch (this.filters.sort) {
            case 'title-asc':
              return a.title.localeCompare(b.title);
            case 'title-desc':
              return b.title.localeCompare(a.title);
            case 'price-asc':
              return parseFloat(a.variants[0].price) - parseFloat(b.variants[0].price);
            case 'price-desc':
              return parseFloat(b.variants[0].price) - parseFloat(a.variants[0].price);
            case 'created-asc':
              return new Date(a.created_at) - new Date(b.created_at);
            case 'created-desc':
              return new Date(b.created_at) - new Date(a.created_at);
            default:
              return 0;
          }
        });
      }

      this.renderProducts();
      this.closeSidebar();
    }

    resetFilters() {
      this.querySelectorAll('input[type="radio"]').forEach(radio => radio.checked = false);
      this.querySelectorAll('input[type="checkbox"]').forEach(checkbox => checkbox.checked = false);
      this.querySelector('[data-price-min]').value = '';
      this.querySelector('[data-price-max]').value = '';
      
      this.filters = {
        sort: null,
        availability: [],
        priceMin: null,
        priceMax: null
      };

      this.applyFilters();
    }

    getWishlist() {
      const stored = localStorage.getItem('wishlist');
      return stored ? JSON.parse(stored) : [];
    }

    saveWishlist() {
      localStorage.setItem('wishlist', JSON.stringify(this.wishlist));
    }

    toggleWishlist(productId, button) {
      const index = this.wishlist.indexOf(productId);
      if (index > -1) {
        this.wishlist.splice(index, 1);
        button.classList.remove('active');
      } else {
        this.wishlist.push(productId);
        button.classList.add('active');
      }
      this.saveWishlist();
    }

    renderProducts() {
      if (this.filteredProducts.length === 0) {
        this.productsGrid.innerHTML = '<div class="ai-no-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}">No products found</div>';
        return;
      }

      this.productsGrid.innerHTML = this.filteredProducts.map(product => {
        const variant = product.variants[0];
        const price = parseFloat(variant.price);
        const comparePrice = variant.compare_at_price ? parseFloat(variant.compare_at_price) : null;
        const onSale = comparePrice && comparePrice > price;
        const isInWishlist = this.wishlist.includes(product.id);

        return `
          <div class="ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}" onclick="window.location.href='/products/${product.handle}'">
              ${product.images[0] ? `<img src="${product.images[0].src}" alt="${product.title}" class="ai-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}" loading="lazy">` : ''}
              <button class="ai-wishlist-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ${isInWishlist ? 'active' : ''}" data-wishlist-btn data-product-id="${product.id}" onclick="event.stopPropagation();">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path>
                </svg>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <a href="/products/${product.handle}" class="ai-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">${product.title}</a>
              <div class="ai-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                ${onSale ? `<span class="ai-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}">${this.formatMoney(comparePrice)}</span>` : ''}
                <span class="${onSale ? 'ai-price-sale-{{ ai_gen_id }}' : 'ai-price-regular-{{ ai_gen_id }}'}">${this.formatMoney(price)}</span>
              </div>
              <button class="ai-add-to-cart-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-variant-id="${variant.id}">Add to Cart</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        `;
      }).join('');

      this.productsGrid.querySelectorAll('.ai-add-to-cart-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}').forEach(button => {
        button.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          e.preventDefault();
          e.stopPropagation();
          this.addToCart(button.dataset.variantId);
        });
      });

      this.productsGrid.querySelectorAll('[data-wishlist-btn]').forEach(button => {
        button.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          e.preventDefault();
          e.stopPropagation();
          this.toggleWishlist(parseInt(button.dataset.productId), button);
        });
      });
    }

    formatMoney(amount) {
      return new Intl.NumberFormat('en-IN', {
        style: 'currency',
        currency: 'INR'
      }).format(amount);
    }

    async addToCart(variantId) {
      try {
        const response = await fetch('/cart/add.js', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: {
            'Content-Type': 'application/json',
          },
          body: JSON.stringify({
            id: variantId,
            quantity: 1
          })
        });

        if (response.ok) {
          window.location.href = '/cart';
        }
      } catch (error) {
        console.error('Error adding to cart:', error);
      }
    }

    setupInfiniteScroll() {
      const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
        entries.forEach(entry => {
          if (entry.isIntersecting && !this.isLoading && this.hasMoreProducts) {
            this.loadProducts();
          }
        });
      }, {
        rootMargin: '200px'
      });

      observer.observe(this.loadingIndicator);
    }
  }

  customElements.define('collection-template-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CollectionTemplate{{ ai_gen_id }});
})();
</script>

